WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,180
Young Master

2
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:03,350
Why is Miss Ping'er here? Master?

3
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,350
Ping'er said

4
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:05,430
Will wait for you to come out

5
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:07,990
What does Miss Ping'er want from me?

6
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:10,850
The young master accepted Ping'er's handkerchief

7
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,370
Pinger is here today

8
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:15,850
I want to ask the young master what he thinks about the handkerchief now

9
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:20,050
Prince, don't worry

10
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:22,690
Ping'er knew that she couldn't reach the level of Young Master

11
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,210
If the young master is interested

12
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:26,170
Ping'er will redeem herself

13
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:27,450
Follow the young master

14
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:28,970
Slavery is a disadvantage

15
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:33,590
She’s also a good girl, Ping’er.

16
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:34,870
Things of the day

17
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:36,270
You don't need to take it to heart

18
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:39,510
Don't you like Ping'er?

19
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,630
I'm just a layman

20
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,830
Naturally, he would like a beauty like this girl

21
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:46,250
It is precisely because of this love

22
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:47,570
I don’t want this

23
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:50,250
Let the girl be wrapped in kindness and write a life for me

24
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:52,060
Prince, don't worry

25
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,580
Throw those things away

26
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,260
Ping'er would also choose this way
